  "title": "ComicConPrague | Štefan Šraga – Photo & Video Production",
  "sections": [
    {
      "text": "SINCE 2015",
      "html": "<p class=\"font_9 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">SINCE 2015</span></p>"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meeting Ghost, Jack Sparrow, and other iconic characters from the world of games and movies all in one day? No problem at Comic-Con Prague. Once again, the atmosphere was amazing – full of creative cosplays and passionate fans everywhere you looked. Here’s a short photo report from the event. I didn’t have as much time this year since I was also filming another fair during the same week, but still – a busy yet fantastic start to April, just the way I like it.",
      "html": "<h2 class=\"font_2 wixui-rich-text__text\">Meeting Ghost, Jack Sparrow, and other iconic characters from the <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"color:#18C118;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">world of games</span></span> and <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"color:#18C118;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">movies</span></span> all in <span style=\"color:#18C118;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">one day</span></span>? No problem at <span style=\"color:#18C118;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Comic-C</span></span><span style=\"color:#18C118;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">on Prague</span></span>. Once again, the atmosphere was amazing – full of creative cosplays and passionate fans everywhere you looked. Here’s a <span style=\"color:#18C118;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">short photo report</span></span> from the event. I didn’t have as much time this year since I was also filming another fair during the same week, but still – a busy yet fantastic start to April, just the <span style=\"color:#18C118;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">way I like it</span></span>.</h2>"
    },
    {
